---
/**
 * Label for paid placements. Fixed text, no props: a sponsored slot can never be shown
 * without it or with a softer wording (docs/prd.md principle 3). Never use for badges.
 */
---

<span class="sponsor-label">Sponsor</span>

<style>
  .sponsor-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--color-accent-text);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-label);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-display);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
